    "video_file_size": 3470902,
    "caption": "🤩 HeyGen Cuts Video Agent Costs 30%\n\nThe HyperFrames team compared its agent with Claude Code using the same model and settings across 17 video creation and editing tasks. The system cost 30% less while keeping video quality at the same level, according to a model judge.\n\nIt runs on DeepSeek Harness and uses a modular plugin system for code-based video creation and editing. A second AI agent reviews test results, proposes plugin changes, and checks new configurations, with successful improvements saved automatically.\n\nThe agent delivered 35% fewer model calls and lower compute costs in 78% of tasks. It is already integrated into HyperFrames Studio, with plans to expand into 3D and automated editing.\n\n📊@tech",
