    "caption": "🤖 Anthropic’s Record IPO Starts at $111.50\n\nThe opening price was $111.50 per share, 34% above the $83 offer price. The valuation briefly topped $2.1 trillion, versus an initial $1.5 trillion.\n\nThe team behind Claude raised more than $107 million, including $26 billion through a private placement. Private investors included Google, Microsoft, Nvidia, and AMD.\n\nShares now trade at $94-97.\n\n📊@tech",
